lines.loadgame.mods_missing:
This game was played with mods that are not installed now:

{mods}

What they added is missing until they are back. Their parts wait on your shelf (an engine of theirs comes out of its car, which gets its factory engine); their events and their dealers' cars are gone.

lines.loadgame.mods_older:
This game was played with newer versions of these mods:

{mods}

What the newer versions added is missing until they are back, and what they changed is as the older ones have it.

lines.settings.ac_folder.restart:
The game will use the Assetto Corsa folder
{folder}
the next time it starts. Restart the game for the change to take effect.

lines.startup.no_ac:
Assetto Corsa was not found at:
{path}

Set the Assetto Corsa folder as "AssettoCorsaPath" in
{settings}
(for example "AssettoCorsaPath": "D:\\Games\\assettocorsa") and start Street Corsa again.

lines.startup.import_failed:
Error importing Assetto Corsa content:
{error}

The Assetto Corsa folder is set as "AssettoCorsaPath" in
{settings}

The details are in the log.

lines.startup.mod_problems:
Some of the mods have problems. What could not be used is left out; the rest of the game plays as usual.

{problems}

Every problem is in the log ({log}).

lines.graphics.runtimes_missing:
Street Corsa's 3D views need runtimes Windows does not come with, and some are missing here:

{runtimes}

Install them and start Street Corsa again; until then the garage, the lots and the streets show no 3D. (Missing: {files})

lines.graphics.view_failed:
The 3D view could not start, so the game's scenes show no 3D:

{error}{missing}

The rest of the game plays as usual. The details are in the log ({log}).

lines.startup.error:
Something went wrong:
{error}

The game carries on; the details are in the log.
